# Production Environment Variables for Arandor Companion App
# 
# IMPORTANT: Copy this file to /srv/arandor/.env on your server
# This file is read by the systemd service via the EnvironmentFile directive
#
# FORMAT REQUIREMENTS:
# - No quotes around values (systemd EnvironmentFile format)
# - No spaces around the = sign
# - Each variable on its own line
# - Lines starting with # are comments
#
# SECURITY:
# - Set proper file permissions: chmod 600 /srv/arandor/.env
# - Ensure only the deploy user can read it: chown deploy:deploy /srv/arandor/.env
# - NEVER commit the actual .env file to git (it's in .gitignore)

# OpenAI API Key for podcast generation feature
# Get your API key from: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# Example: OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-abc123xyz...
OPENAI_API_KEY=REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_ACTUAL_OPENAI_API_KEY

# Optional: Custom uploads directory for podcast audio files
# Defaults to /srv/arandor/uploads if not specified
# UPLOADS_DIR=/custom/path/to/uploads
